meta {
  name: Get Manga Download Status
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/manga/:id/download
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  id: one-piece.49
}

assert {
  res.status: in [200, 400]
}

docs {
  # Get Manga Download Status
  Queries the live progress and status of an active or completed background download task for a given manga.

  ### Path Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `id` | string | **Yes** | Manga Katana slug identifier (e.g. `one-piece.49`). |

  ### Responses
  - **`200 OK`**: Current progress status.
    ```json
    {
      "manga_id": "one-piece.49",
      "is_downloading": true,
      "queued_count": 10,
      "completed_count": 3,
      "error_count": 0,
      "remaining_count": 7
    }
    ```
}
